  "title": "AGNICO EAGLE ANNOUNCES INVESTMENT IN WALLBRIDGE MINING COMPANY LIMITED",
  "summary": "(NYSE: AEM) (TSX: AEM) (\"Agnico Eagle\" or the \"Company\") announced today that it entered into a subscription agreement with Wallbridge Mining Company Limited (\"Wallbridge\"), pursuant to which Agnico Eagle agreed to purchase 243,927,966 common shares of Wallbridge (\"Common Shares\") at a price of C$0.092 per Common Share for total consideration of C$22,441,373 (the \"Private Placement\"). The Private Placement is subject to certain closing conditions, including approval of the Toronto Stock Exchange",
